{"suttaId":"tha-ap304","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[9065,9077],"vripara":"5"},"segments":{"tha-ap304:0.3":"Sabbagandhiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap304:1.1":"“Gandhamālaṃ mayā dinnaṃ, vipassissa mahesino;","tha-ap304:1.3":"Adāsiṃ ujubhūtassa, koseyyavatthamuttamaṃ.","tha-ap304:2.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, yaṃ vatthamadadiṃ [gandhamadadiṃ (syā.)] pure;","tha-ap304:2.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, gandhadānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap304:3.1":"“Ito pannarase kappe, suceḷo nāma khattiyo;","tha-ap304:3.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap304:4.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap304:5.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā sabbagandhiyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap304:6.1":"Sabbagandhiyattherassāpadānaṃ dutiyaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
